        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"Pshaw!\""
    },
    {
      "start": 70,
      "end": 104,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"have you not done with dreaming?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 419,
      "end": 431,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"Ah, Isaac,\""
    },
    {
      "start": 442,
      "end": 588,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"all that is exhausted; you have rung so many changes on your hopes and your dreams, that you have nothing left but to make them real—if you can.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 2372,
      "end": 2405,
      "labels": [
        "other"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"shuffling off this mortal coil,\""
    },
    {
      "start": 2828,
      "end": 2859,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"What is this all to be about?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 2902,
      "end": 2947,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "Isaac",
      "text": "\"About love, and toil, and duty, and sorrow,\""
    },
    {
      "start": 3065,
      "end": 3111,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "Tabitha",
      "text": "\"How many times have you been in love, Isaac?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 3149,
      "end": 3157,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "Isaac",
      "text": "\"Pshaw!\""
    },
    {
      "start": 3391,
      "end": 3421,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"Isaac, you are a sad fellow!\""
    },
    {
      "start": 3530,
      "end": 3543,
      "labels": [
        "other"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"bad fellow.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 5752,
      "end": 5757,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"Ah,\""
    },
    {
      "start": 5833,
      "end": 5945,
      "labels": [
        "speech"
      ],
      "note": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "\"there is, after all, but one youth-time; and if you put down its memories once, you can find no second growth.\""
    }
  ]
}